# SAVE as a Berlinan document (AppServices.saveDocument): the project and the snapshot slots to flash, and both
# back after a restart as they were. The template (on a seed of its own), the key, the tempo and a channel changed
# stopped, the density while playing (the project's at once, the engine's at the next bar), slot 2 stored at the
# render head after ten bars (the patterns mutated), SAVE, a reboot: the same project, slot 2 lit and holding the
# same patterns; recalled after the reboot, the engine plays them from the next bar. pat_hash: FNV-1a 64 over the
# running engine's patterns (their notes, not their lifecycles); slot_pat2: the same over slot 2's.
proj template demo 0x5EED1234
proj key 2 dorian
proj tempo 120
proj channel bass 5
expect tpl 0
expect root 2
expect mode 1
expect bpm 120
expect chan2 5
expect seed_hi 0
expect seed_lo 0x5EED1234
tap PLAY
wait 2000
proj density 40
expect density_pct 40
wait 18000
slot store 2
expect slot_used2 1
expect pat_hash_hi 0x442d3fdd
expect slot_pat2_hi 0x442d3fdd
expect pat_hash_lo 0x65e6daaf
expect slot_pat2_lo 0x65e6daaf
tap PLAY
expect playing 0
tap SAVE
expect store_writes 2
reboot
expect playing 0
expect tpl 0
expect root 2
expect mode 1
expect bpm 120
expect chan2 5
expect density_pct 40
expect seed_lo 0x5EED1234
expect slot_used2 1
expect slot_used1 0
wait 50
expect slot_lit2 1
expect slot_lit1 0
expect slot_pat2_hi 0x442d3fdd
expect slot_pat2_lo 0x65e6daaf
# after the reboot: the project's own patterns (generation 0's), then slot 2's from bar 2 (tick 7680), before any of
# them loops; the recall pushed an undo point
tap PLAY
wait 3000
expect pat_hash_hi 0xabd25f74
slot recall 2
expect undo_depth 1
wait 1500
expect head >7680
expect head <11280
expect pat_hash_hi 0x442d3fdd
expect pat_hash_lo 0x65e6daaf
